{"seq":24,"trial_id":"v04-cal-r1-2026-11/hermes-opus-gbrain-told-live-rr-l2-mu-v04-dev/rr-08-l2-tansley-parcel-site-retired/r2","wall_ts":"2026-11-06T15:46:39.642Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-17T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"7dc78b3c572ee21c7df801dfd529c2c4195e58e3ffcc44f07216e112bd43b3e8","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV04CAL0001","text":"Hi Tobias, here's what I found for the Tansley Parcel file:\n\n1. Label printing stall (carrier API outage, 3 Sep 2025): the depot was Southgate. Pree posted in #inc-tansley-carrier-api that Southgate dispatch had totes stacked beside door 4. The incident was resolved that evening once labels were printing again and Southgate had cleared the backlog.\n\n2. Yard jockey login problem at the Tulsa hub: the contact is Lev Arkadin. In #central-team on 2 Jul 2025, Pree said Lev had messaged her about it. Nothing I can see gives his title or contact details, so you might check with Pree for those."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV04CAL0001","ts":"1792245600.000126"}}
